{"id":"pre_cise_ment","lemma":"précisément","pos":"adv","rank":2468,"glosses":["in a precise manner; without approximation","specifically","exactly, precisely"],"ipa":"/pʁe.si.ze.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c7/Fr-pr%C3%A9cis%C3%A9ment.ogg/Fr-pr%C3%A9cis%C3%A9ment.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Attends précisément ici.","en":"Wait right here.","words":[{"g":"to wait for, to await","l":"attendre"},null,{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Je sais précisément qui c'est.","en":"I know exactly who it is.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"savoir"},null,{"g":"who"},{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"}]},{"text":"Fais précisément ce que je dis.","en":"Do exactly as I say.","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},null,null,null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"dire"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"what"]]},{"text":"Il est précisément celui que tu cherches.","en":"He is precisely the one you are looking for.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"the one"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to look for, to seek","l":"chercher"}]},{"text":"C'est précisément ce que je voulais.","en":"This is just what I wanted.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,null,null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"what"]]}]}